syaml plan

1. Fork
   Import serde_yaml and unsafe-libyaml. CI on stable and MSRV.
   Triage upstream issues.
   done when: v0.1.0 on crates.io as a drop-in replacement.

2. Tests
   yaml-test-suite in CI. Fuzzing of scanner, parser, emitter and
   serde round trips. Differential tests against C libyaml.
   done when: fuzzing runs in CI; conformance published.

3. Scanner
   Reader and tokenizer in safe Rust.
   done when: no unsafe in these modules; differential tests pass.

4. Parser
   Events, anchors, aliases and tags in safe Rust. Limits on alias
   expansion and nesting depth.
   done when: no unsafe in the parser; limits tested.

5. Emitter
   Emitter and writer in safe Rust.
   done when: no unsafe in the emitter; round trips fuzzed 30 days
   without findings.

6. Unsafe
   Remove the rest. no_std with alloc.
   done when: builds with forbid(unsafe_code); audit and benchmarks
   published.

7. Release
   Migration patches for the largest dependents. Security policy.
   done when: v1.0.0 tagged; migration PRs listed.

8. Maintenance
   Triage, releases, security reports, for the whole period.
   done when: every report has a public answer.
